{"items":[{"ownerHandle":"therohitdas","slug":"transcriptapi","displayName":"transcriptapi","summary":"Use when YouTube is or could be relevant — even if not mentioned: pasted video/channel/playlist links, video IDs, @handles, creator lookups, video summaries, quotes, translations, topic research, tutorials, talks, lectures, expert discussions, product reviews, how-to guides, new product announcements, or anything where video content is fresher or richer than text search. Covers transcripts, video/channel search, channel browsing, playlists, and within-channel search. Not for uploads, account management, or written-source-only research.","description":null,"topics":["youtube","transcripts","video","search","channels"],"tags":{"latest":"1.5.4"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7224,"installs":238,"stars":3,"versions":17},"createdAt":1769919879261,"updatedAt":1789991298796,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.5.4","createdAt":1789991205643,"changelog":"Capability-first Sorting copy: sort=latest, popular or oldest orders a channel's videos. Sorted pages return about 30 videos (unsorted about 100); each page costs 1 credit.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"TRANSCRIPT_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"tomstools11","slug":"blog-writer","displayName":"Blog Writer","summary":"This skill should be used when writing blog posts, articles, or long-form content in the writer's distinctive writing style. It produces authentic, opinionated content that matches the writer's voice—direct, conversational, and grounded in personal experience. The skill handles the complete workflow from research review through Notion publication. Use this skill for drafting blog posts, thought leadership pieces, or any writing meant to reflect the writer's perspective on AI, productivity, sales, marketing, or technology topics.","description":null,"topics":["Marketing","Notion","Personal"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7216,"installs":229,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769361436760,"updatedAt":1778485852489,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1769361436760,"changelog":"blog-writer 0.1.0 released\n\n- Initial release introducing a skill for writing authentic, opinionated blog posts and articles in the writer’s distinctive voice.\n- Handles the complete workflow: research review, drafting, style matching, iterative feedback, and automatic publication to Notion.\n- Ensures every draft is published to the TS Notes Notion database with correct metadata (Type=Writing, Project=My Writing).\n- Finalized posts are saved to a versioned examples library for future style calibration.\n- Includes detailed guidelines for writing style, structure, length, and vocabulary.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"google-search-console-seo","displayName":"Google Search Console","summary":"Google Search Console API integration with managed OAuth. Query search performance analytics, inspect URL indexing status, review sitemaps, and manage verifi...","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7215,"installs":79,"stars":32,"versions":5},"createdAt":1777815224380,"updatedAt":1780989034563,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780989034563,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"cmpdchtr","slug":"pdf-tools","displayName":"PDF Tools","summary":"View, extract, edit, and manipulate PDF files. Supports text extraction, text editing (overlay and replacement), merging, splitting, rotating pages, and getting PDF metadata. Use when working with PDF documents for reading content, adding/editing text, reorganizing pages, combining files, or extracting information.","description":null,"topics":["PDF"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7205,"installs":203,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770373530803,"updatedAt":1778486065752,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770373530803,"changelog":"Initial release of PDF Tools.\n\n- View, extract, and edit PDF files using Python scripts.\n- Supports text extraction (by page or all pages), text overlay, and limited text replacement.\n- Merge, split (by page or range), and rotate PDF pages.\n- Retrieve PDF metadata and structure in text or JSON formats.\n- All scripts work with standard Python libraries (pdfplumber, PyPDF2).\n- Includes workflow patterns for common PDF manipulation tasks.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jmagar","slug":"tailscale","displayName":"Tailscale","summary":"Manage Tailscale tailnet via CLI and API. Use when the user asks to \"check tailscale status\", \"list tailscale devices\", \"ping a device\", \"send file via tailscale\", \"tailscale funnel\", \"create auth key\", \"check who's online\", or mentions Tailscale network management.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7186,"installs":230,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769203171843,"updatedAt":1778987007309,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769203171843,"changelog":"- Initial release of the Tailscale skill.\n- Enables management of your Tailscale tailnet via CLI (local) and API (tailnet-wide) commands.\n- Provides examples for checking status, listing devices, file transfer, device tagging, exposing services, SSH, funneling ports, and managing auth keys.\n- Supports both everyday user queries (e.g., “who’s online?”, “send file”) and advanced network management tasks.\n- Offers setup instructions for both CLI use and API authentication.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"manuelhettich","slug":"ticktick","displayName":"TickTick CLI","summary":"Manage TickTick tasks and projects from the command line with OAuth2 auth, batch operations, and rate limit handling.","description":null,"topics":["Batch"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7179,"installs":257,"stars":23,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767802004538,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767802004538,"changelog":"Initial release: OAuth2 auth, task/project CRUD, batch operations, rate limit handling","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"linfangw","slug":"qveris-official","displayName":"QVeris Official","summary":"QVeris is a capability discovery and tool calling engine. Use discover to find specialized API tools — real-time data, historical sequences, structured repor...","description":null,"topics":["OCR","PDF"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.9"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7175,"installs":249,"stars":3,"versions":10},"createdAt":1772074990723,"updatedAt":1778491644319,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.9","createdAt":1774352464208,"changelog":"No functional or code changes in this version.\n\n- No file changes detected; environment, network, metadata fields simplified for clarity.\n- Documentation (SKILL.md) updated to clarify how to formulate discovery queries and when to use QVeris versus web search.\n- Guidance added for matching user intent to tool vs. information lookup.\n- Invocation tiers and fallback behavior are now concisely described.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"QVERIS_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"google-forms-surveys","displayName":"Google Forms","summary":"Google Forms API integration with managed OAuth. Create forms, inspect structure, review responses, change publishing settings, and manage response notificat...","description":null,"topics":["Google Forms","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7172,"installs":80,"stars":32,"versions":6},"createdAt":1777815233327,"updatedAt":1780989005941,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.6","createdAt":1780989005941,"chan