息，覆盖 A股、港股、基金、指数、财务、公告、研报和宏观经济等 200+ 接口。Use when: 用户要查股票走势、基金净值、指数行情、财务报表、估值指标、公告研报、机构观点、宏观数据、板块主题、产业链、市场统计，或要拉取、导出、对比结构化金融数据。Do not use when: 用户要直接买卖建议、自动下单、交易执行、非金融数据查询、系统运维排查，或在无数据时要求编造结论。","description":null,"topics":["股票","财务","A股","公告","基金"],"tags":{"a-share":"1.8.97","etf":"1.8.97","finance":"1.8.97","financial-data":"1.8.97","fund":"1.8.97","hk-stock":"1.8.97","index":"1.8.97","investment-research":"1.8.97","latest":"1.8.97","macro-economics":"1.8.97","market-data":"1.8.97","quantitative":"1.8.97","quote":"1.8.97","stock":"1.8.97"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":7156,"installs":89,"stars":3,"versions":118},"createdAt":1773654072608,"updatedAt":1792078598796,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.8.97","createdAt":1792078178598,"changelog":"Automated scheduled docs release","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"slack-workspace","displayName":"Slack","summary":"Send messages, manage channels, handle files, and coordinate team communication in Slack via the Slack API. Use this skill when users want to send messages,...","description":null,"topics":["Slack"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7153,"installs":71,"stars":33,"versions":2},"createdAt":1777821510172,"updatedAt":1780841176905,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.1","createdAt":1780841176905,"changelog":"Add/fix Setup in 3 Steps GIF table so connection GIFs render correctly.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"rikouu","slug":"agent-task-tracker","displayName":"Task Tracker","summary":"Proactive task state management. Use on EVERY task start, progress update, completion, or failure. Tracks what was requested, what's running (background proc...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7151,"installs":228,"stars":4,"versions":2},"createdAt":1771436917633,"updatedAt":1778491574637,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1771441209751,"changelog":"Add 50-line/2KB size limit, completed task compression to one-line summaries, auto-prune >3 days","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"aaron-he-zhu","slug":"technical-seo-checker","displayName":"Technical Seo Checker","summary":"Use when the user asks to \"check technical SEO\"; audits crawlability, indexing, Core Web Vitals, robots.txt, sitemaps, canonicals, redirects, and migrations....","description":null,"topics":["Crawl","Health"],"tags":{"core-web-vitals":"7.2.0","latest":"19.0.0","page-speed":"7.2.0","seo":"7.2.0","site-audit":"7.2.0","technical-seo":"7.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":6,"downloads":7147,"installs":162,"stars":6,"versions":30},"createdAt":1770559636397,"updatedAt":1784910013630,"latestVersion":{"version":"19.0.0","createdAt":1784906230358,"changelog":"Version 19.0.0 introduces a major cleanup and refactor.\n\n- Removed multiple reference and template files to streamline the skill.\n- Added distribution-manifest.json.\n- Updated SKILL.md metadata to version 19.0.0.\n- No functional logic or audit workflow changes noted.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"baiduqianfangroup","slug":"ai-notes-of-video","displayName":"AI Notes of Video","summary":"Generate document, outline, and image-text AI notes by providing a video URL, using Baidu's video analysis and note extraction APIs.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7143,"installs":217,"stars":4,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770275533347,"updatedAt":1778486025837,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770275533347,"changelog":"- Initial release of ai-notes-of-video skill.\n- Generate three types of AI notes (document, outline, image-text) from user-provided video URLs using Baidu’s API.\n- Added workflow and API usage to create and query note generation tasks.\n- Requires BAIDU_API_KEY to be set in environment.\n- Detailed documentation included for setup, parameters, and note types.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"azaidi94","slug":"claude-code-usage","displayName":"claude-code-usage","summary":"Check Claude Code OAuth usage limits (session & weekly quotas). Use when user asks about Claude Code usage, remaining limits, rate limits, or how much Claude usage they have left. Includes automated monitoring to notify when quotas reset.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7140,"installs":237,"stars":16,"versions":3},"createdAt":1768853741579,"updatedAt":1789016778462,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1768854249379,"changelog":"Added automated monitoring: Get notified when session/weekly quotas reset. Includes monitor-usage.sh script and setup helpers.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["darwin","linux"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"cntuang","slug":"image-vision","displayName":"Image Vision","summary":"Analyze and interpret images by describing content, extracting text, answering questions, comparing visuals, and extracting structured data from JPG, PNG, GI...","description":null,"topics":["OCR"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7138,"installs":221,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773618895799,"updatedAt":1778491933006,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773618895799,"changelog":"Image analysis skill using multimodal vision models","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jiacode","slug":"deepresearchwork","displayName":"Deep Research Work From Xian.LaoJ","summary":"Comprehensive research framework that combines web search, content analysis, source verification, and iterative investigation to conduct in-depth research on any topic. Use when you need to perform thorough research with multiple sources, cross-validation, and structured findings.","description":null,"topics":["Web Search"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7136,"installs":248,"stars":17,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770284984284,"updatedAt":1778486025837,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770284984284,"changelog":"Initial release of Deep Research skill, a comprehensive research framework.\n\n- Provides a structured workflow for in-depth, multi-source research and verification.\n- Includes detailed steps for planning, gathering, analyzing, and synthesizing information.\n- Integrates web, content, and memory tools for thorough research and source evaluation.\n- Offers guidance on source credibility, temporal relevance, and balancing perspectives.\n- Supplies templates and best practices for generating structured research reports.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"g9pedro","slug":"clawvault","displayName":"ClawVault","summary":"Agent memory system with memory graph, context profiles, checkpoint/recover, structured storage, semantic search, observational memory, task tracking, canvas...","description":null,"topics":["Agent Memory","Memory System"],"tags":{"Memory":"1.3.1","Super Memory":"1.3.1","context death resilience":"1.3.1","context graphs":"1.11.6","latest":"2.5.13","qmd":"1.3.1"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":7115,"installs":243,"stars":9,"versions":43},"createdAt":1769944462842,"updatedAt":1778485932126,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.5.13","createdAt":1771202098326,"changelog":"Schema conformance pass: remove non-spec openclaw metadata keys, add source field, and keep only documented requirement/install/homepage fields for stable registry parsing.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"google-ads-campaigns","displayName":"Google Ads","summary":"Inspect Google Ads accounts and campaigns, run GAQL reports, and coordinate campaign or audience changes with confirmation via the Google Ads API. Use this s...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7112,"installs":78,"stars":33,"versions":6},"createdAt":1777815228672,"updatedAt":1780988943431,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780988943431,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jeffjhunter","slug":"ai-daily-briefing","displayName":"AI Daily Briefing","summary":"Start every day focused. Get a morning briefing with overdue tasks, today's priorities, calendar overview, and context from recent meetings. Works with ai-meeting-notes to-do list. No setup. Just say 'briefing'.","description":null,"topics":["Calendar","Daily Briefing","Priorities","Meeting Notes","Daily Ops"],"tags":{"calendar":"1.0.0","daily-briefing":"1.0.0","daily-ops":"1.0.0","focus":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","morning-routine":"1.0.0","planning":"1.0.0","priorities":"1.0.0","productivity":"1.0.0","task-management":"1.0.0","todo":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7105,"installs":217,"stars":20,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770143080318,"updatedAt":1778486000320,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770143080318,"changelog":"v1.0.0 — Initial Release\n\n☀️ FEATURES\n- Morning briefing with overdue, priorities, calendar, context\n- Focus statement — ONE thing to concentrate on\n- Weekly preview mode\n- End-of-day variant (adapts to time)\n- Integrates with ai-meeting-notes to-do list\n- Customizable preferences\n\nBuilt by Jeff J Hunter","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"sherajdev","slug":"deploy-agent","displayName":"C.R.A.B Deploy Agent","summary":"Multi-step deployment agent for full-stack apps. Build → Test → GitHub → Cloudflare Pages with human approval at each step.","description":null,"topics":["Deploy","Deployment","GitHub"],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":7101,"installs":250,"stars":2,"versions":2},"createdAt":1768726668598,"updatedAt":1778485733200,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1768834943838,"changelog":"Added Next.js + D1 deployment guide and pre-deployment checks