summary":"Generate images with Seedream4.5 and videos with Kling via LiblibAI API. Use when user asks to generate/create images, pictures, illustrations, or videos using LiblibAI, Seedream, or Kling models.","description":null,"topics":["Video Generation"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6750,"installs":207,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770558994467,"updatedAt":1778486086401,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770558994467,"changelog":"Initial release of liblib-ai-gen.\n\n- Enables image generation using Seedream4.5 via the LiblibAI API.\n- Supports video generation (text-to-video and image-to-video) with Kling models.\n- Provides CLI with options for prompt, model, image size, reference images, and video duration.\n- Includes async task handling with status polling.\n- Requires LIB_ACCESS_KEY and LIB_SECRET_KEY environment variables for API access.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jackycser","slug":"seedance-video-generation","displayName":"Seedance Video Generation","summary":"Generate AI videos using ByteDance Seedance. Use when the user wants to: (1) generate videos from text prompts, (2) generate videos from images (first frame, first+last frame, reference images), or (3) query/manage video generation tasks. Supports Seedance 1.5 Pro (with audio), 1.0 Pro, 1.0 Pro Fast, and 1.0 Lite models.","description":null,"topics":["Video Generation","Audio"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.3"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6748,"installs":209,"stars":18,"versions":4},"createdAt":1770701416300,"updatedAt":1778989419820,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.3","createdAt":1770883878648,"changelog":"- Added LICENSE.txt file to the repository.\n- Established an explicit license for the seedance-video-generation skill.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"linux","displayName":"Linux","summary":"Debugs and hardens Linux hosts: permissions, disk full, OOM kills, stuck processes, systemd units, cron, networking, SSH, and boot failures. Use when a service starts by hand but fails at boot, a process ignores kill -9, df and du disagree, a box runs out of memory or inodes, sudo or ACLs deny access, SELinux blocks a write, a job works in the shell but not in cron, sshd rejects a key, an upgrade leaves packages half-configured, load is high while the CPU sits idle, or a host needs firewall rules, users, LVM, journald, kernel tuning, or a security baseline. Also for setting up a fresh server, deciding what to alert on, backups whose restore has never been tested, a host that may be compromised, and desktop or laptop trouble — GPU drivers, Wayland, suspend, audio, Wi-Fi. Covers Debian/Ubuntu, RHEL/Fedora, Arch, Alpine, SUSE and WSL. Not for shell-script syntax (bash) or container build and runtime internals (docker).","description":null,"topics":["Permission"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6743,"installs":160,"stars":8,"versions":7},"createdAt":1770677640742,"updatedAt":1785146166741,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.6","createdAt":1785140911217,"changelog":"Clearer disclosure of what is stored and where","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"buddyh","slug":"alexa-cli","displayName":"Alexa CLI","summary":"Control Amazon Alexa devices and smart home via the `alexacli` CLI. Use when a user asks to speak/announce on Echo devices, control lights/thermostats/locks, send voice commands, or query Alexa.","description":null,"topics":["Smart Home"],"tags":{"alexa":"0.2.0","echo":"0.2.0","home automation":"0.2.0","latest":"1.3.0","smart home":"0.2.0","text to speech":"0.2.0","tts":"0.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6742,"installs":182,"stars":14,"versions":7},"createdAt":1767496419580,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.3.0","createdAt":1770915784622,"changelog":"Simplify metadata: flatten structure, remove nested tags","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"callmedas69","slug":"credential-manager","displayName":"Credential Manager","summary":"MANDATORY security foundation for OpenClaw. Consolidate scattered API keys and credentials into a secure .env file with proper permissions. Use when setting up OpenClaw, migrating credentials, auditing security, or enforcing the .env standard. This is not optional — centralized credential management is a core requirement for secure OpenClaw deployments. Scans for credential files across common locations, backs up existing files, creates a unified .env with mode 600, validates security, and enforces best practices.","description":null,"topics":["Credential Management"],"tags":{"latest":"1.3.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6741,"installs":194,"stars":2,"versions":4},"createdAt":1770299849985,"updatedAt":1779076709262,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.3.0","createdAt":1770436388201,"changelog":"Consolidation Rule enforcement - all credentials MUST be in ~/.openclaw/.env ONLY. Enhanced detection for workspace/skills/scripts .env files. New CONSOLIDATION-RULE.md documentation.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"video-generation","displayName":"AI Video Generation","summary":"Create AI videos with Sora 2, Veo 3, Seedance, Runway, and modern APIs using reliable prompt and rendering workflows.","description":null,"topics":["Video Generation","Prompt"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6739,"installs":200,"stars":8,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770860905397,"updatedAt":1778487906275,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1772754387865,"changelog":"Added current model routing and practical API playbooks for modern AI video generation workflows.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"~/video-generation/","required":true}],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"alvarobcmed","slug":"travel-manager","displayName":"Travel Manager","summary":"Comprehensive travel planning, booking, and management skill. Use when needing to plan international trips, manage multi-destination itineraries, handle family travel logistics, optimize travel costs, and coordinate complex travel arrangements.","description":null,"topics":["Travel Planning"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6731,"installs":234,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770221563265,"updatedAt":1778486017068,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770221563265,"changelog":"Initial release of travel-manager skill with comprehensive travel planning features.\n\n- Supports international trip planning and multi-destination itineraries\n- Handles family travel logistics and age-specific needs\n- Offers cost optimization and travel document management\n- Includes defined workflow for efficient travel coordination\n- Provides references for family travel and international document requirements","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jhillin8","slug":"habit-tracker","displayName":"Habit Tracker","summary":"Build habits with streaks, reminders, and progress visualization","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6727,"installs":227,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769326386777,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769326386777,"changelog":"Initial release of habit-tracker.\n\n- Track daily and weekly habits with streak counts and progress visualization.\n- Log habit completions via conversation.\n- Set reminders for specific habits.\n- Flexible support for daily, weekly, or custom cadence habits.\n- Options to pause, archive, or review habit statistics.\n- All data stored locally for privacy.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"toller892","slug":"github-ai-trends","displayName":"GitHub AI Trends","summary":"Generate GitHub AI trending project reports as formatted text leaderboards. Fetches top-starred AI/ML/LLM repos by daily, weekly, or monthly period and renders a styled leaderboard. Use when the user asks for AI project trends, GitHub trending, AI leaderboard, or wants to see popular AI repos.","description":null,"topics":["GitHub"],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6724,"installs":224,"stars":10,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770801984065,"updatedAt":1778487899210,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1770802121478,"changelog":"Changed output from HTML to formatted text for direct chat display","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"sereinzhi","slug":"generate-excel","displayName":"Create an Excel (.xlsx) file containing formatted data.","summary":"Create a formatted Excel (.xlsx) spreadsheet from provided 2D data, applying styles, colors, alignment, and auto-adjusted column widths.","description":null,"topics":["Spreadsheets"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6723,"installs":176,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773758384899,"updatedAt":1778491977901,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773758384899,"changelog":"Excel Generator Skill 1.0.0 – Initial Release\n\n- Generate professional Excel (.xlsx) spreadsheets from user data, tables, or reports.\n- Supports rich cell formatting: bold, text color, background color, and alignment.\n- Auto-adjusts column widths for optimal readability.\n- Handles missing dependencies automatically during file creation.\n- Converts chat tables or structured requests into downloadable Excel files.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"elithrar","slug":"web-perf","displayName":"Web Perf","summary":"Analyzes web performance using Chrome DevTools MCP. Measures Core Web Vitals (FCP, LCP, TBT, CLS, Speed Index), identifies render-blocking resources, network dependency chains, layout shifts, caching issues, and accessibility gaps. Use when asked to audit, profile, debug, or optimize page load performance, Lighthouse scores, or site speed.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6720,"installs":224,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767685545091,"updatedAt":1779139299091,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767685545091,"changelog":"Initial release of the web-perf skill – a web performance audit tool powered by Chrome DevTools MCP. \n\n- Audits Core Web Vitals (FCP, LCP, TBT, CLS, Speed Index) and provides detailed breakdowns.\n- Identifies render-blocking resources, network dependency chains, and caching issues.\n- Spots high-level accessibility gaps with a snapshot tool.\n- Offers workflow and tool usage checklist for step-by-step auditing.\n- Includes clear output formatting and actionable, prioritized recommendations.\n- Guides analysis of codebase optimizations when source code is available; otherwise audits third-party sites externally.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"jotform","displayName":"JotForm","summary":"JotForm API integration with managed OAuth. Create forms, manage submissions, and access form data. Use this skill when users want to interact with JotForm forms and submissions. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a JotForm connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a JotForm action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with JotForm examples; they add no JotForm capability - JotForm is not an event source, a trigger cannot read JotForm data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.9"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6715,"installs":208,"stars":3,"versions":17},"createdAt":1770023590819,"updatedAt":1790938571395,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.9","createdAt":1790938442379,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"xwchris","slug":"xhs-cover-skill","displayName":"Xhs Cover Skill","summary":"生成小红书风格封面图片。使用场景：(1) 用户要求生成小红书封面 (2) 用户要求生成社交媒体封面图 (3) 用户为笔记/文章生成配图 (4) 用户询问 credit 余额或生成历史。首次使用会自动引导注册。","description":null,"topics":["小红书"],"tags":{"latest":"3.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6713,"installs":189,"stars":2,"versions":3},"createdAt":1772763241554,"updatedAt":1778995796803,"latestVersion":{"version":"3.0.0","createdAt":1775748863191,"changelog":"改用 npx xhscover，支持终端内注册登录，移除手动 API Key 配置","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"hermes-agent","displayName":"Hermes Agent","summary":"Turn OpenClaw into a learning-loop agent with seeded workspace rules, skill promotion, reflective memory, and proactive maintenance.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6713,"installs":188,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773251263094,"updatedAt":1778491839794,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773251263094,"changelog":"Added the first Hermes-style OpenClaw loop with setup, memory, workspace seed, and promotion rules.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"johnsondevops","slug":"last30days-skill","displayName":"Last 30 Days","summary":"Research any topic across Reddit, X, YouTube, and the web from the last 30 days. Returns synthesized expert answers and copy-paste prompts.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6707,"installs":110,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771753973763,"updatedAt":1778992342586,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771753973763,"changelog":"last30days-skill v1.0.0 — Initial Release\n\n- Enables research on any topic discussed in the last 30 days across Reddit, X, YouTube, and the web.\n- Automatically parses user intent to identify topic, target tool, and research type before any research begins.\n- Transparently displays parsed user intent to confirm understanding before running research scripts.\n- Performs a comprehensive foreground research script combining recent Reddit/X/YouTube data, followed by focused WebSearch.\n- Synthesizes findings to deliver actionable, copy-paste-ready prompts or insights, grounded in up-to-date, real-world discussions.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"OPENAI_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"larsonreever","slug":"codeconductor","displayName":"CodeConductor.ai","summary":"AI-powered platform for rapid full-stack app development, autonomous agents, workflow automation, and scalable product creation with low-code and AI integrat...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1","latest Code Conductor SKILL CC ai":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":6702,"installs":166,"stars":0,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769510527236,"updatedAt":1779127479361,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1769511109379,"changelog":"Get ready to deploy applications and manage projects with complete CLI reference with codeconductor.ai. Commands for deployments, projects, domains, environment variables, and live documentation access.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ziad-hsn","slug":"critical-code-reviewer","displayName":"Critical Code Reviewer","summary":"Conduct rigorous, adversarial code reviews with zero tolerance for mediocrity. Use when users ask to \"critically review\" my code or a PR, \"critique my code\", \"find issues in my code\", or \"what's wrong with this code\". Identifies security holes, lazy patterns, edge case failures, and bad practices across Python, R, JavaScript/TypeScript, SQL, and front-end code. Scrutinizes error handling, type safety, performance, accessibility, and code quality. Provides structured feedback with severity tiers (Blocking, Required, Suggestions) and specific, actionable recommendations.","description":null,"topics":["Javascript","Typescript","SQL"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6699,"installs":211,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770553916936,"updatedAt":1778486077727,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770553916936,"changelog":"Initial release of critical-code-reviewer — a ruthlessly high-standard adversarial code review skill.\n\n- Detects security flaws, lazy patterns, edge case failures, and bad practices across Python, R, JavaScript/TypeScript, SQL, and front-end code.\n- Flags issues in error handling, type safety, performance, accessibility, and code quality with structured severity tiers (Blocking, Required, Suggestions, Noted).\n- Implements explicit detection for typical sloppiness, structural problems, language-specific red flags, and incomplete solutions.\n- Provides direct, actionable, and constructively brutal feedback, with the option to group and discuss issues or post reviews as PR comments.\n- Clearly explains boundaries when context is missing and calibrates severity and recommendations accordingly.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"3coco3","slug":"playwright-scraper","displayName":"Playwright Scraper","summary":"Scrapes websites using Playwright with stealth mode to bypass bot detection, supporting dynamic JS content and customizable viewport and User-Agent.","description":null,"topics":["Playwright"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6697,"installs":209,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772761294752,"updatedAt":1779077684226,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772761294752,"changelog":"- Initial release of Playwright Stealth Scraper for OpenClaw.\n- Enables scraping of dynamic websites with anti-bot defenses using Playwright and stealth plugins.\n- Supports JavaScript-heavy sites including SPAs and React apps.\n- Allows custom viewport and User-Agent spoofing.\n- Provides the \"stealth_scrape\" tool for scraping by URL.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"phheng","slug":"amazon-competitor-analyzer","displayName":"Amazon Competitor Analyzer","summary":"Scrapes Amazon product data from ASINs using browseract.com automation API and performs surgical competitive analysis. Compares specifications, pricing, revi...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6697,"installs":201,"stars":7,"versions":7},"createdAt":1770390964826,"updatedAt":1778486065752,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.6","createdAt":1772008504998,"changelog":"- No changes detected in this version; all documentation and configurations remain the same as the previous release.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ttyyyy8517-ship-it","slug":"stock-research-engine","displayName":"stock-research-engine","summary":"个股基本面深度研究引擎。当用户输入股票代码、公司名称或要求分析某只股票时触发。覆盖A股、港股、美股。输出买方基金经理视角的投资分析简报，包含市场情绪、基本面、管理层评估、业务拆解、催化剂日历、风险提示和估值数据展示。任何涉及\"帮我看看这个票\"、\"分析一下XXX\"、\"这个公司怎么样\"、\"XXX值不值得买\"、股票代码...","description":null,"topics":["Stock","投资","研究"],"tags":{"latest":"3.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6693,"installs":220,"stars":13,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772683349471,"updatedAt":1778491726627,"latestVersion":{"version":"3.0.0","createdAt":1772683349471,"changelog":"- Major upgrade with a new, rigorous buy-side investment research process.\n- Now covers A-shares, Hong Kong, and US stocks; triggered by stock symbols, names, or investment analysis requests.\n- Outputs a structured, concise Markdown brief focused on investment decision-making, with explicit separation of facts and opinions.\n- Analysis includes market sentiment, company fundamentals, management assessment, business breakdown, catalyst calendar, risks, and valuation, all with strict data discipline.\n- Prioritizes cross-verified, up-to-date financials and user-provided data; avoids speculation and filler.\n- Designed for both single and batch stock analysis, supporting rapid, high-density research.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"fiddlybit","slug":"whisper","displayName":"whisper","summary":"End-to-end encrypted agent-to-agent private messaging via Moltbook dead drops. Use when agents need to communicate privately, exchange secrets, or coordinate without human visibility.","description":null,"topics":["Messaging"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6691,"installs":204,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769879823084,"updatedAt":1779076525383,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769879823084,"changelog":"Initial public release of Whisper: agent-to-agent encrypted messaging via Moltbook.\n\n- Enables end-to-end encrypted communication between agents using X25519, Ed25519, and AES-256-CBC+HMAC-SHA256.\n- Implements dead drop (dropbox) pattern for secure message relaying via Moltbook.\n- Provides commands for identity generation, key publishing, agent discovery, encryption, sending/receiving messages, and message decryption.\n- Stores all keys, sessions, contacts, and messages locally with strict file permissions for privacy.\n- Requires OpenSSL (3.x+), curl, and jq for operation.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"asleep123","slug":"bitwarden","displayName":"Bitwarden","summary":"Access and manage Bitwarden/Vaultwarden passwords securely using the rbw CLI.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":6658,"installs":192,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1768798973352,"updatedAt":1779076390596,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768798973352,"changelog":"Initial release","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","macos"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"picaye","slug":"cron-scheduler","displayName":"Cron Scheduler","summary":"Create, list, modify, and remove scheduled cron jobs to automate system tasks using simplified cron syntax and manage output logging.","description":null,"topics":["Cron"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6656,"installs":228,"stars":4,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771915165780,"updatedAt":1778992794716,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771915165780,"changelog":"- Initial release of Cron Scheduler skill.\n- Manage, create, and monitor system and user cron jobs easily.\n- No API key required; works directly with system commands.\n- Includes commands to list, add, remove, and monitor cron jobs as well as check logs.\n- Features extensive usage examples, common cron patterns, syntax help, and best practices.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"aizain","slug":"ai-news-zh","displayName":"AI News ZH - 中文AI科技日报","summary":"中文AI科技日报自动采集与推送。从The Verge、Wired、TechCrunch等英文源抓取最新AI资讯，自动翻译整理为中文，按分类推送到飞书/Telegram/Discord等渠道。适合关注AI行业动态的中文用户。","description":null,"topics":["News","日报","Telegram","飞书"],"tags":{"ai":"1.0.0","chinese":"1.0.0","daily-briefing":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","news":"1.0.0","rss":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6651,"installs":225,"stars":13,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772166548204,"updatedAt":1778491656611,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772166548204,"changelog":"AI News ZH 1.0.0 首次发布，支持自动采集和推送最新AI新闻至多平台。\n\n- 从 The Verge、Wired、TechCrunch 等英文科技媒体自动抓取AI新闻\n- 智能筛选相关内容，自动翻译整理为中文\n- 支持新闻分类（大模型、Agent、融资、安全、应用、开源）\n- 可定时推送到飞书、Telegram、Discord 等渠道\n- 实现新闻去重与增量更新，保证日报新鲜有序","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"visualdeptcreative","slug":"daily-report","displayName":"Daily Report","summary":"Generate daily, weekly, and alert reports tracking leads, outreach, cost, priorities, and issues, saving structured summaries for progress monitoring.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6648,"installs":221,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770291915487,"updatedAt":1778486029224,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770291915487,"changelog":"- Initial release of daily-report skill, providing automated daily, end-of-day, and weekly reporting templates.\n- Tracks lead pipeline, outreach, metrics, and budget in structured reports.\n- Saves daily log summaries to memory files for future reference.\n- Includes support for immediate alerts on replies, budget thresholds, API errors, and blockers.\n- Designed for use with a local ollama model for cost-free, simple aggregation.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"fetcher-sh","slug":"google-search","displayName":"google-search","summary":"A Google Search API alternative and SERP API alternative on fetcher.sh — pay-per-call in USDC via x402, or prepaid credits with a Bearer key, no API key application. Use when the user wants programmatic Google search results as clean JSON, including Google's own operators — site:, filetype:, intitle:, and quoted exact phrases — plus pagination, language (hl), and country/region scoping. Also covers rank tracking input, competitive research, and search-result monitoring without Google's own Custom Search API quota and billing.","description":null,"topics":["google","search","research"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6645,"installs":0,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1787305042381,"updatedAt":1787305095169,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787305042381,"changelog":"Initial release of the google-search skill:\n\n- Provides programmatic access to Google search results as clean JSON with support for search operators (site:, filetype:, intitle:, exact phrases).\n- No need for Google Custom Search Engine, per-day quotas, or billing accounts.\n- Simple HTTP GET requests with pay-per-call (USDC/x402) or prepaid credits (Bearer key).\n- Supports pagination, UI language (hl), and country/region scoping.\n- Includes error codes and multiple usage scenarios for convenience.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"koatora20","slug":"guard-scanner","displayName":"Guard Scanner","summary":"Security scanner and runtime guard for OpenClaw skills, MCP servers, and AI agent workflows. Detects prompt injection, identity hijacking, memory poisoning,...","description":null,"topics":["Prompt Injection","Json","Policy"],"tags":{"agent-security":"13.0.1","latest":"16.0.2","mcp":"16.0.2","openclaw":"16.0.2","prompt-injection":"16.0.2","runtime-guard":"13.0.1","scanner":"5.0.7","security":"16.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6638,"installs":216,"stars":2,"versions":17},"createdAt":1771285692932,"updatedAt":1779219042241,"latestVersion":null,"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"anoyix","slug":"agent-stock","displayName":"agent-stock","summary":"股市 AI 量化交易，用于获取股市实时数据、选股、交易决策、持仓分析、量化交易决策等。","description":null,"topics":["Stock","交易决策","持仓分析","选股","量化交易决策"],"tags":{"latest":"0.2.8"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6626,"installs":187,"stars":5,"versions":19},"createdAt":1773648723412,"updatedAt":1778491943830,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.2.8","createdAt":1777122339980,"changelog":"Release 0.2.8","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"pntrivedy","slug