 Pro","summary":"Professional AI Trading Mentor. Master price action, technical analysis, and risk management logic. Companion logic model for the Day Trading Investor Course.","description":null,"topics":["Day Trading","Investing","Risk Management","Technical Analysis"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6607,"installs":228,"stars":14,"versions":3},"createdAt":1770808214408,"updatedAt":1778487899210,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.2","createdAt":1771497685107,"changelog":"- Updated iOS companion app link to include tracking parameters for improved analytics.\n- No changes to the skill logic or user-facing capabilities.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"kowl64","slug":"linux-service-triage","displayName":"Linux & service basics","summary":"Diagnoses common Linux service issues using logs, systemd/PM2, file permissions, Nginx reverse proxy checks, and DNS sanity checks. Use when a server app is failing, unreachable, or misconfigured.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6602,"installs":212,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1768664250014,"updatedAt":1778986939992,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768664250014,"changelog":"linux-service-triage 1.0.0 – Initial Release\n\n- Diagnoses Linux service issues via logs, systemd/PM2, file permissions, Nginx reverse proxy, and DNS sanity checks.\n- Provides a triage report with likely cause, evidence, and minimal fix plan.\n- Outputs exact fix commands only on user request and when safe.\n- Covers service restarts, permissions fixes, Nginx/DNS troubleshooting, and systemd/PM2 process handling.\n- Emphasizes safety: read-only by default, requires confirmation for changes, and avoids destructive actions.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"al-one","slug":"mcp-hass","displayName":"🏠 Home Assistant via MCP protocol","summary":"The skill for control Home Assistant smart home devices and query states using MCP 