"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6554,"installs":221,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770218475811,"updatedAt":1778486017068,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770218475811,"changelog":"Initial release of exa-search skill:\n\n- Integrates Exa (exa.ai) Search API for web search via a local Node script.\n- Supports structured web results: title, URL, snippet, and optionally full text.\n- Configuration via EXA_API_KEY environment variable.\n- Provides commands for searching, retrieving page text, and filtering by date range.\n- Acts as an Exa-backed alternative and does not change existing web search skills.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"EXA_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fetcher-sh","slug":"google-news","displayName":"Google News API","summary":"A Google News API alternative on fetcher.sh — pay-per-call in USDC via x402, or prepaid credits with a Bearer key, no RSS scraping. Use when the user wants keyword search across Google News scoped to a language edition, section headlines (world, business, technology, entertainment, sport, science, health, or a specific topic ID), the latest headlines, a list of supported language-region codes, or to decode a Google News redirect URL into the real article URL. Also covers news monitoring, headline aggregation, media tracking, and press-mention alerts without scraping Google News' RSS feeds directly.","description":null,"topics":["news","world"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6552,"installs":1,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1787304636810,"updatedAt":1787304692775,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787304636810,"changelog":"Initial release of the google-news skill — a clean, pay-per-call Google News API alternative.\n\n- Provides JSON endpoints for keyword search, section/latest headlines, specific topic IDs, supported language/region codes, and redirect URL decoding\n- No RSS scraping or undocumented internal endpoints required\n- Simple HTTP GET with payment via x402 (USDC) or prepaid credits (Bearer API key)\n- Supports media monitoring, news aggregation, and press mention alerts\n- Includes full error handling and documentation for authentication and endpoint usage","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"caopulan","slug":"openclaw-config","displayName":"OpenClaw Config","summary":"Help edit and validate OpenClaw config","description":null,"topics":["Json"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6550,"installs":227,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770453145213,"updatedAt":1778486069788,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770453145213,"changelog":"- Initial release of openclaw-config skill.\n- Edit and validate OpenClaw Gateway config (openclaw.json / JSON5) with schema-first workflow.\n- Guides users through safe config editing, strict validation, and use of $include for modular configuration.\n- Includes best practices, troubleshooting steps, and common configuration examples for channels, tools, and security.\n- Comprehensive documentation for locating schemas, resolving validation errors, and maintaining strict security policies.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"zlc000190","slug":"requesting-code-review","displayName":"Requesting Code Review","summary":"Use when completing tasks, implementing major features, or before merging to verify work meets requirements","description":null,"topics":["Code Review"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6544,"installs":153,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770691916262,"updatedAt":1778486278647,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770691916262,"changelog":"Initial release: 请求代码审查","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"cellcog","slug":"instagram-reels-tiktok-cellcog","displayName":"Instagram Reels","summary":"AI social media video and content creation powered by CellCog. Instagram Reels, TikTok videos, Stories, carousels, social posts. Full video production from a single prompt — scripted, shot, stitched, and scored automatically.","description":null,"topics":["Content Creation","Prompt"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.18"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6540,"installs":160,"stars":20,"versions":19},"createdAt":1770408518938,"updatedAt":1787537014877,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.18","createdAt":1787536955063,"changelog":"Content updated.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"CELLCOG_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":["darwin","linux","windows"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"zhangxinyu0330","slug":"dolphindb-skill","displayName":"Dolphindb","summary":"DolphinDB 时序数据库完整技术文档与最佳实践。包含1490个技术文档 + 3份官方白皮书。涵盖数据库设计、流计算、量化回测、函数查询等全场景。","description":null,"topics":["Dolphindb","Database","数据库","Backtesting","Quantitative Trading"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6534,"installs":108,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773307269770,"updatedAt":1778491852854,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773307269770,"changelog":"DolphinDB Skill 2.0.0 — 全新升级，覆盖1490篇技术文档与3份官方白皮书，涵盖数据库、流计算、量化回测等全场景。\n\n- 新增官方白皮书（数据库/流计算/量化回测）并分类组织，支持生产级架构与实战策略开发\n- 技术文档全面扩展至1490篇，细分函数、引擎、运维、API等类别，提供完整索引\n- 增加大量常见问题导航与实用代码示例，覆盖从新手入门到高级场景\n- 对数据库设计、流计算、量化回测等全流程给出最佳实践和决策要点\n- 明确按场景/角色查阅路径，为架构师、DBA、开发和量化研究等不同角色优化内容查找","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"mrsirg97-rgb","slug":"torchmarket","displayName":"Torch Market","summary":"Every token is its own margin market. Depth-adaptive risk engine, treasury-backed lending, real-token short selling. No oracles. No stored baselines. No keep...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"11.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6530,"installs":218,"stars":6,"versions":89},"createdAt":1770248760451,"updatedAt":1779233706516,"latestVersion":{"version":"11.1.0","createdAt":1779233680500,"changelog":"- Updated SDK to torchsdk@^11.1.0 and all installation instructions.\n- Added new files: lib/torchsdk/events.d.ts, lib/torchsdk/events.js, and verification.md.\n- Removed VERIFICATION.md.\n- No user-facing functionality changes documented.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"[object Object]","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"tmchow","slug":"telegram-compose","displayName":"Telegram Compose","summary":"Format and deliver rich Telegram messages with HTML formatting via direct Telegram API.\nAuto-invoked by the main session for substantive Telegram output — no other skills need to call it.\nDecision rule: If your Telegram reply is >3 lines or contains structured data (lists, stats, sections, reports),\nspawn this as a Haiku sub-agent to format and send. Short replies (<3 lines) go directly via OpenClaw message tool.\nHandles: research summaries, alerts, status updates, reports, briefings, notifications — anything with visual hierarchy.","description":null,"topics":["Telegram","Message"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.4"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6528,"installs":215,"stars":4,"versions":5},"createdAt":1769575509137,"updatedAt":1778987266916,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.4","createdAt":1770935193951,"changelog":"**Summary:**  \nThis update requires callers to explicitly specify the Telegram bot account for all deliveries; auto-selection of accounts is no longer allowed.\n\n- The bot account name (e.g., \"main\") must now be provided by the caller for every message; the skill will not auto-select or iterate accounts.\n- Session/task templates and documentation updated to require explicit `Bot account: <account_name>` specification.\n- Credentials section and all usage examples revised to validate and use only the specified account.\n- Added `metadata` with OS, binary, network, and credential requirements.\n- Improved error handling and validation message if account is missing or invalid.\n- No runtime/code file changes—documentation only.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"channels.telegram.accounts.<account>.botToken","required":true}],"os":["darwin","linux"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"xrowgmbh","slug":"xrowgmbh-gitlab-agent","displayName":"GitLab Agent","summary":"Operate assigned GitLab work with owner-verified project access and guarded MR delivery.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.114.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6523,"installs":29,"stars":1,"versions":156},"createdAt":1780504992638,"updatedAt":1792458463654,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.114.0","createdAt":1792458191503,"changelog":"- Removed the file skill-card.md from the skill package.\n- No functional or behavioral changes to the skill logic or usage.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"michaelwang11394","slug":"video-agent","displayName":"Video Agent (Deprecated)","summary":"[DEPRECATED — uses outdated v1/v2 endpoints] Use `create-video` for prompt-based video generation (v3 Video Agent) or `avatar-video` for precise avatar/scene...","description":null,"topics":["Video Generation","Prompt"],"tags":{"ai-avatar":"2.13.0","ai-video":"2.13.0","avatar":"2.13.0","deprecated":"2.23.0","digital-human":"2.13.0","heygen":"2.23.0","latest":"2.23.0","talking-head":"2.13.0","text-to-video":"2.13.0","video":"2.23.0","video-generation":"2.13.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6518,"installs":221,"stars":7,"versions":22},"createdAt":1770054382427,"updatedAt":1778485994101,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.23.0","createdAt":1776103932448,"changelog":"Deprecated — use create-video or avatar-video instead","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"HEYGEN_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"1kalin","slug":"weekly-report-generator","displayName":"Weekly Report Generator","summary":"Auto-generate structured weekly business reports covering KPIs, accomplishments, blockers, and plans. Save hours of reporting time every week.","description":null,"topics":["Business"],"tags":{"analytics":"1.0.0","business":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","reporting":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6500,"installs":222,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770951134128,"updatedAt":1778488088696,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770951134128,"changelog":"Initial release! Weekly Report Generator helps users quickly create structured, actionable business reports.\n\n- Provides templates for Executive, Team, Sales, Marketing, and Project Status weekly reports.\n- Covers sections like KPIs, accomplishments, blockers, plans, and risks.\n- Emphasizes insights, comparatives, and brevity for leadership audiences.\n- Designed to save hours on reporting each week.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"loonghao","slug":"dcc-mcp-creator","displayName":"DCC-MCP Creator","summary":"Create and modernize DCC-MCP adapters","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"0.19.113"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6495,"installs":52,"stars":0,"versions":171},"createdAt":1779695321243,"updatedAt":1792120504495,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.19.113","createdAt":1792120338295,"changelog":"- Bumped version to 0.19.113 in SKILL.md metadata.\n- No other changes made.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fetcher-sh","slug":"google-maps-api","displayName":"Google Maps API","summary":"A Google Maps API alternative and Google Places API alternative on fetcher.sh — pay-per-call in USDC via x402, or prepaid credits with a Bearer key, no Google Cloud billing account. Use when the user wants to search places by text query or anchor the search to a latitude/longitude coordinate, fetch a place's full details by its feature ID (fid), pull a place's reviews sorted by relevance/newest/rating, or look up a single review by ID. Also covers local business discovery, points-of-interest data, store-locator input, and review monitoring without Google Cloud Platform's API key setup, billing, and per-request pricing.","description":null,"topics":["maps","google","location","geo","coordinates"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6489,"installs":1,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1787304651467,"updatedAt":1787304708805,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787304651467,"changelog":"- Major update: Migrated from Scavio API to fetcher.sh’s Google Maps API alternative.\n- Endpoints now use simple HTTP GET with pay-per-call pricing (no Google Cloud or API keys needed).\n- Supports both prepaid credits (Bearer key) and automatic x402 micro-payments.\n- Four endpoints: place search, place details, place reviews, and single review fetch.\n- Easier setup—no Google billing account or request quotas; simple authentication and transparent pricing.\n- Updated documentation, examples, and error handling to match the new API.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"yuyonghao-123","slug":"yuyonghao-summarize","displayName":"Summarize","summary":"Summarize URLs or files with the summarize CLI (web, PDFs, images, audio, YouTube).","description":null,"topics":["Summarize"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6487,"installs":162,"stars":8,"versions":1},"createdAt":1774587633057,"updatedAt":1778492232025,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1774587633057,"changelog":"- Initial release of the Summarize skill.\n- Supports summarizing web URLs, PDFs, images, audio files, and YouTube links via the CLI.\n- Allows choosing models from OpenAI, Anthropic, xAI, or Google Gemini; defaults to Gemini 3 Flash Preview.\n- Includes flexible output controls (summary length, token limits, JSON output).\n- Provides fallback extraction via Firecrawl and YouTube extraction with Apify.\n- Configurable using API keys and optional config file.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"codedao12","slug":"facebook","displayName":"Facebook","summary":"OpenClaw skill for Facebook Graph API workflows focused on Pages posting, comments, and Page management using direct HTTPS requests.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6486,"installs":220,"stars":9,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769965310711,"updatedAt":1778485946485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1770028711580,"changelog":"Version 1.0.1\n\n- Expanded documentation with six new reference files covering Graph API overview, Page posting, comments moderation, permissions/tokens, webhooks, and HTTP request examples.\n- Updated guidance to focus on direct HTTPS requests for Facebook Pages: posting, comment management, and Page operations.\n- Clarified required inputs (App ID/Secret, Page ID, token strategy).\n- Added detailed security and operational guardrails.\n- Clearly defined recommended use cases and limitations.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"afengzi","slug":"market-news","displayName":"Market News","summary":"自动搜索和总结最新财经新闻与市场动态","description":null,"topics":["News","新闻"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6472,"installs":206,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773644024073,"updatedAt":1778491940346,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773644024073,"changelog":"market-news 1.0.0 初始版本发布\n\n- 自动搜索和总结最新财经新闻与市场动态\n- 支持新闻摘要、政策解读、市场综述、公司公告分析\n- 涵盖全球市场联动，包括美股、港股及商品期货\n- 信息仅供参考，鼓励多渠道核实","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"aranej","slug":"clawd-docs-v2","displayName":"Clawd Docs V2","summary":"Smart ClawdBot documentation access with local search index, cached snippets, and on-demand fetch. Token-efficient and freshness-aware.","description":null,"topics":["Docs","Documentation"],"tags":{"latest":"2.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6465,"installs":219,"stars":16,"versions":6},"createdAt":1768423508903,"updatedAt":1778485733200,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.2.0","createdAt":1769402464206,"changelog":"MAJOR: Migrated from brightdata to native web_fetch tool - zero cost documentation access! Removed mcporter dependency. Added curl-based refresh script.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"janhcla","slug":"clawdbot-documentation-expert","displayName":"Clawdbot Documentation Expert","summary":"Expert guidance on navigating, understanding, configuring, troubleshooting, and automating Clawdbot using official documentation and config snippets.","description":null,"topics":["Documentation"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":3,"downloads":6462,"installs":214,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1768237244010,"updatedAt":1779144853382,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768237244010,"changelog":"- Initial release of Clawdbot Documentation Expert skill.\n- Provides a decision tree to help users find relevant Clawdbot documentation by topic or problem.\n- Lists core scripts for searching, indexing, and tracking changes in documentation.\n- Gives summaries of all major documentation categories.\n- Offers instructions for sharing config snippets and linking to source docs.\n- Includes example interactions to guide usage and troubleshooting steps.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"brennerspear","slug":"parallel-ai-research","displayName":"Research","summary":"Conduct open-ended research on a topic, building a living markdown document. Supports interactive and deep research modes.","description":null,"topics":["Document"],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":6462,"installs":193,"stars":0,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770131694045,"updatedAt":1778988067226,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1771978283881,"changelog":"Updated from agent-skills repo","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"thincher","slug":"minimax-web-search","displayName":"minimax-web-search","summary":"使用 MiniMax MCP 进行网络搜索。触发条件：(1) 用户要求进行网络搜索、在线搜索、查找信息 (2) 需要查询最新资讯、新闻、资料 (3) 使用 MiniMax 的 web_search 功能","description":null,"topics":["Web Search","网络搜索"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.7"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":6460,"installs":206,"stars":2,"versions":5},"createdAt":1771336626107,"updatedAt":1778991196834,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.7","createdAt":1772112435593,"changelog":"- 简化并缩短了 API Key 配置流程说明，移除代理配置自动提取部分。\n- 删除了执行流程的完整示例对话，突出直接操作步骤。\n- 文档说明由“首次需要安装，后续直接调用”优化为“首次需要安装，后续直接步骤4调用”。\n- 其它内容及脚本调用说明未变，功能保持一致。","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"hubspot-api","displayName":"HubSpot","summary":"HubSpot API integration with managed OAuth. The documented surface is CRM: contacts, companies, deals, associations, and properties. What is reachable is decided by the OAuth grant the user approved for this connection, which HubSpot enforces on every request: if that grant covers marketing, CMS, conversations or automation scopes, those APIs are reachable too. This skill uses the CRM endpoints and asks before touching any other. Use this skill when users want to create or update CRM records, search contacts, or sync data with HubSpot; anything outside CRM needs the user to ask for that endpoint by name. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a HubSpot connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a HubSpot action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with HubSpot examples; they add no HubSpot capability - HubSpot is itself an event source, so its own events are in `references/hubspot/triggers.md`, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["CRM","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.9"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6449,"installs":188,"stars":5,"versions":18},"createdAt":1770023458241,"updatedAt":1790938451268,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.9","createdAt":1790938293387,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fetcher-sh","slug":"yelp-api","displayName":"Yelp API","summary":"A Yelp API alternative on fetcher.sh — pay-per-call in USDC via x402, or prepaid credits with a Bearer key, no Yelp Fusion API app approval. Use when the user wants to search local businesses by query and location sorted by rating or review count, fetch a business's full details by ID or by its Yelp URL handle/slug, or fetch a business's reviews. Also covers local business discovery, restaurant/service research, review sentiment input, and competitor monitoring for local businesses without Yelp Fusion API's app-approval process and daily call caps.","description":null,"topics":["reviews","restaurant","places","poi","geo"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6448,"installs":2,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1787305596177,"updatedAt":1787305650877,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787305596177,"changelog":"- Initial release of the yelp skill, providing a pay-per-call Yelp API alternative via fetcher.sh.\n- Supports business search by query and location, retrieving details by ID or Yelp URL handle/slug, and fetching business reviews.\n- No Yelp Fusion API app approval or daily call caps required; pay with USDC (x402) or prepaid credits.\n- All endpoints return clean JSON and cost $0.003 per call.\n- Includes full documentation for authentication, endpoints, error handling, and agent setup.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"financial-ai-analyst","slug":"mx-financial-assistant","displayName":"mx-financial-assistant","summary":"基于东方财富权威金融数据库，打造覆盖\"数据-资讯-知识-分析-决策\"全链条的智能问答服务。通过自然语言交互， 为用户提供从基础金融知识科普到专业投资研究支持的全方位解决方案，实现\"一问即达\"的高效金融信息获取体验。 涵盖七大核心能力：全市场金融数据实时查询（A港美股、基金、债券）、全网财经资讯智能检索（公告、研报...","description":null,"topics":["Financial","投资组合","数据库","知识问答","资产配置"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6448,"installs":202,"stars":4,"versions":3},"createdAt":1775044746424,"updatedAt":1778492348942,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1776424758139,"changelog":"Publish 1.0.2","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"EM_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fetcher-sh","slug":"google-play-api","displayName":"Google Play","summary":"A Google Play Store API alternative on fetcher.sh — pay-per-call in USDC via x402, or prepaid credits with a Bearer key, no Google Play Console access. Use when the user wants to search Android apps by keyword with price (free/paid) and country storefront filters, fetch an app's full details, reviews sorted by newest/rating/helpfulness, permissions, or data safety disclosure, list apps similar to a given app, or fetch a developer's app catalog. Also covers Android app store optimization (ASO) research, competitor app monitoring, review sentiment input, and app discovery without Google Play Console developer access.","description":null,"topics":["reviews","mobile","android"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6438,"installs":1,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1787304676982,"updatedAt":1787304728559,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787304676982,"changelog":"Initial release: enables access to Google Play Store data without Play Console or scraping.\n\n- Search Android apps by keyword, price (free/paid), and country filters\n- Fetch detailed app information, reviews (with sorting), permissions, and data safety disclosures\n- List similar apps and fetch a developer's complete app catalog\n- Pay-per-call with USDC via x402 or use prepaid credits with an API key\n- Suitable for ASO research, competitor monitoring, and app discovery without developer access","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"fetcher-sh","slug":"youtube-api","displayName":"Youtube API","summary":"A YouTube API alternative on fetcher.sh — pay-per-call in USDC via x402, or prepaid credits with a Bearer key, no OAuth and no daily quota. Use when the user wants to search YouTube videos with filters for upload date, duration, or sort order, search channels or playlists, look up a channel by ID, @handle, or custom URL path, list a channel's videos, shorts, or live streams, fetch a video's or short's details and comments, list a playlist's videos, pull posts under a hashtag, or check trending videos by region. Also covers YouTube data pipelines, channel monitoring, video analytics input, and trend tracking without the official YouTube Data API's daily quota limits.","description":null,"topics":["media","videos","creative"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6433,"installs":1,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1787305582290,"updatedAt":1787305649254,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787305582290,"changelog":"Major upgrade: New YouTube API powered by fetcher.sh, offering credit and x402 payment options, expanded endpoints, and advanced search/filtering.\n\n- Replaced TranscriptAPI integration with fetcher.sh, dropping OAuth and Google quota constraints.\n- Added support for 15 endpoints, including filtered video/channel/playlist search, channel/video/shorts lookups, comments, hashtags, and trending feeds.\n- Authentication now via prepaid API key or x402 pay-per-call (USDC, multiple chains supported).\n- Plain HTTP GET interface, $0.005 per call, no daily quota or rate limits.\n- Comprehensive examples and usage scenarios included.\n- Removed deprecated documentation and references to old endpoints.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"qlifebot-coder","slug":"ralph-loops","displayName":"Ralph Loops","summary":"Runs autonomous iterative AI loops for requirements, planning, or building phases using structured prompts and fresh context per iteration.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6431,"installs":216,"stars":1,"versions":3},"createdAt":1769935113980,"updatedAt":1779076602641,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1769936024664,"changelog":"Added warning: don't block conversation while monitoring loops","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"wumu2013","slug":"multi-factor-strategy","displayName":"multi-factor-strategy","summary":"Guide users to create multi-factor stock selection strategies and generate independent YAML configuration files","description":null,"topics":["Stock"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6417,"installs":182,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769945475858,"updatedAt":1778485932126,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769945475858,"changelog":"Initial release – helps users build multi-factor stock selection strategies with YAML configuration for QuantCLI.\n\n- Guides users through strategy goal setting, factor selection, weight configuration, and YAML file generation.\n- Supports both inline and external (file-based) factor definitions in strategies.\n- Provides detailed YAML examples and step-by-step workflow for creating custom stock screening and ranking logic.\n- Documents available factor expressions, built-in Alpha101 factors, and QuantCLI command usage.\n- Suitable for both fundamental and technical multi-factor strategies.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"emasoudy","slug":"screen-monitor","displayName":"Screen Monitor","summary":"Dual-mode screen sharing and analysis. Model-agnostic (Gemini/Claude/Qwen3-VL).","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6414,"installs":222,"stars":4,"versions":2},"createdAt":1768808043799,"updatedAt":1779076518075,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1768808574667,"changelog":"- Updated manifest.json and README.md (SKILL.md) for minor improvements.\n- No functional changes to the skill or usage instructions.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"zorrong","slug":"computer-vision-expert","displayName":"Computer Vision Expert","summary":"SOTA Computer Vision Expert (2026). Specialized in YOLO26, Segment Anything 3 (SAM 3), Vision Language Models, and real-time spatial analysis.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6412,"installs":214,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770262051316,"updatedAt":1778486022044,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770262051316,"changelog":"Initial release of Computer Vision Expert (SOTA 2026):\n\n- Provides expert guidance on state-of-the-art computer vision, including YOLO26, SAM 3, and Vision Language Models.\n- Covers real-time detection, promptable segmentation, and advanced spatial/3D reasoning.\n- Includes best practices for edge deployment, text-guided vision pipelines, and geometry-based reconstruction.\n- Documents common anti-patterns and sharp-edge issues for 2026-era vision models.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"peturgeorgievv","slug":"postfast","displayName":"postfast","summary":"Schedule and manage social media posts across TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, X (Twitter), YouTube, LinkedIn, Threads, Bluesky, Pinterest, Telegram, and Google Business Profile using the PostFast API. Use when the user wants to schedule social media posts, manage social media content, upload media for social posting, list connected social accounts, check scheduled posts (filtered by account, platform, status or date), delete posts one at a time or up to 100 per call, cross-post content to multiple platforms, manage Google Business Profile posts, geotag posts with real-world places, pick trending pre-cleared TikTok sounds for photo and carousel posts, read or reply to the comments on their posts (social inbox on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, Threads), triage or moderate comment conversations, generate a connect link so an agency client or their own app's user can connect accounts without a PostFast account, or automate their social media workflow. PostFast is a SaaS tool, no self-hosting required.","description":null,"topics":["Business","LinkedIn","Schedule","Telegram","Twitter"],"tags":{"analytics":"1.6.2","api":"1.19.0","google-business-profile":"1.5.1","instagram":"1.2.0","latest":"1.19.0","linkedin":"1.2.0","pinterest":"1.2.0","postfast":"1.19.0","scheduling":"1.19.0","social-media":"1.19.0","telegram":"1.2.0","tiktok":"1.2.0","youtube":"1.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6406,"installs":118,"stars":8,"versions":37},"createdAt":1770897649490,"updatedAt":1791462526993,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.19.0","createdAt":1791462289069,"changelog":"YouTube video language and captions: controls.youtubeLanguage (BCP-47 code) and controls.youtubeCaptionKey (an .srt or .vtt upload via contentType application/x-subrip or text/vtt, max 10MB, needs a language), the four new error codes, and a new example youtube-video-captions.json.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"POSTFAST_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"zich-dev","slug":"linkedin-automation","displayName":"LinkedIn Automation by Zich (BradAI's OpenClaw)","summary":"Automate LinkedIn content creation, posting, engagement tracking, and audience growth. Use for posting content, scheduling posts, analyzing engagement metrics, generating content ideas, commenting on posts, and building LinkedIn presence. Requires browser access with LinkedIn logged in.","description":null,"topics":["LinkedIn","Content Creation","Browser"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":6397,"installs":221,"stars":23,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769856129853,"updatedAt":1778485878349,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769856129853,"changelog":"Initial release: Automate LinkedIn content creation, posting, engagement, and analytics.\n\n- Post and schedule content (with optional images) directly to LinkedIn.\n- Track post analytics, audience growth, and engagement metrics.\n- Generate content ideas based on trending LinkedIn topics.\n- Automate liking and commenting on posts to boost engagement.\n- Includes strategies, workflows, and troubleshooting guides for effective LinkedIn automation.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"adamsardo","slug":"codex-sub-agents","displayName":"OpenAI Codex Sub Agents","summary":"Use OpenAI Codex CLI for coding tasks. Triggers: codex, code review, fix CI, refactor code, implement feature, coding agent, gpt-5-codex. Enables Clawdbot to delegate coding work to Codex CLI as a subagent or direct tool.","description":null,"topics":["Code Review","Subagent","Coding"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6373,"installs":206,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769484036381,"updatedAt":1778987194150,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769484036381,"changelog":"- Updated skill.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"gitgoodordietrying","slug":"docker-sandbox","displayName":"Docker Sandbox","summary":"Create and manage Docker sandboxed VM environments for safe agent execution. Use when running untrusted code, exploring packages, or isolating agent workloads. Supports Claude, Codex, Copilot, Gemini, and Kiro agents with network proxy controls.","description":null,"topics":["Docker"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6371,"installs":218,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770151659792,"updatedAt":1778486013286,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770151659792,"changelog":"Initial release - Docker Desktop sandbox VM management for safe agent execution with network proxy controls, workspace mounting, and troubleshooting guides.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"wemeeting","slug":"tencent-meeting-skill","displayName":"腾讯会议","summary":"腾讯会议：会议管理与音视频协作助手。预约/创建/修改/取消会议、查询会议详情与会议号转换、查看参会成员/受邀人/等候室成员、管理会中等候室成员、查询用户会议列表（即将开始/进行中/已结束）、搜索会议列表、导出参会成员统计与获取异步任务结果、查询录制列表与播放地址、搜索录制文件、获取转写全文/段落/搜索、获取AI智能纪要（支持多语言翻译）、搜索与查询元宝纪要（支持关键词/时间过滤、获取概览/要点/待办/滚动总结）、录制权限申请（预览+提交两步流程）、企业通讯录搜索/按手机号或邮箱批量查询用户（获取open_id）、向会议添加/移除/替换受邀人（创建或修改会议时可一并指定）、会中批量呼叫成员入会、","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.15"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6349,"installs":130,"stars":4,"versions":10},"createdAt":1773514095632,"updatedAt":1788353922261,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.15","createdAt":1788353762054,"changelog":"- 新增支持“元宝纪要”相关功能，包括纪要搜索、要点/待办获取和滚动总结。\n- 在描述中明确“元宝纪要”检索能力，支持关键词、时间过滤与概览提取。\n- 移除 skill-card.md 文件，无影响实际功能使用。\n- 业务与规则、场景说明增补元宝纪要相关指引。\n- 其余核心功能、约束和敏感操作规范保持不变。","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"TENCENT_MEETING_TOKEN","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"audio","displayName":"Audio","summary":"Process, enhance, and convert audio files with noise removal, normalization, format conversion, transcription, and podcast workflows.","description":null,"topics":["Audio","Podcast","Transcription"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6349,"installs":99,"stars":2,"versions":2},"createdAt":17