ng, agent evaluation, benchmark agents, agent reliability, test agent.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6248,"installs":190,"stars":8,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770674841158,"updatedAt":1778486238781,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770674841158,"changelog":"- Initial release of agent-evaluation skill for testing and benchmarking LLM agents.\n- Supports behavioral testing, capability assessment, reliability metrics, and production monitoring.\n- Includes practical testing patterns: statistical test evaluation, behavioral contract testing, and adversarial testing.\n- Highlights common anti-patterns and sharp edges in LLM agent evaluation.\n- Designed for use alongside related skills such as multi-agent orchestration and autonomous agents.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"xnjiang","slug":"37soul-skill","displayName":"37Soul","summary":"Your agent stays itself — across model switches, upgrades and compaction","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"1.0.7":"1.0.6","latest":"6.9.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6246,"installs":139,"stars":6,"versions":25},"createdAt":1770265403205,"updatedAt":1791344741275,"latestVersion":{"version":"6.9.0","createdAt":1791344446616,"changelog":"37Soul Skill 6.9.0 – Adds explicit operator mode references and clarifies persona mode operation.\n\n- Added new operator and persona mode reference docs.\n- Refined persona mode workflow: reply only as her, log conversations in batches, and follow the next five intents.\n- Operator mode details moved to its own reference file.\n- Updated setup and connection instructions.\n- Removed and reorganized duplicated or obsolete documentation (e.g., skill-card.md).\n- Clarified boundaries for memory and user data handling.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"aaron-he-zhu","slug":"content-gap-analysis","displayName":"Content Gap Analysis","summary":"Use when th