table/YAML/JSON).\n- Offers enhanced interactivity and discoverability compared to curl-based alternatives. \n- Includes setup instructions, common commands, and usage tips for a richer CLI experience.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"franky0617","slug":"crypto-gold-monitor","displayName":"加密货币与贵金属监控","summary":"加密货币与贵金属价格监控 / Crypto & Precious Metals Price Monitor - 监控BTC/ETH实时价格、黄金(XAU)/白银(XAG)走势，免费API无需Key","description":null,"topics":["Crypto","加密货币"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6244,"installs":212,"stars":7,"versions":5},"createdAt":1769732835461,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.1","createdAt":1769733658786,"changelog":"撤回每克价格显示","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"lao9s","slug":"mixpost","displayName":"Mixpost","summary":"Mixpost is a self-hosted social media management software that helps you schedule and manage your social media content across multiple platforms including Facebook, Twitter/X, Instagram, LinkedIn, Pinterest, TikTok, YouTube, Mastodon, Google Business Profile, Threads, Bluesky, and more.","description":null,"topics":["Social Media Management","Business","LinkedIn","Schedule","Twitter"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6243,"installs":216,"stars":7,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770135797706,"updatedAt":1778486000320,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770135797706,"changelog":"Initial release of the Mixpost skill.\n\n- Provides integration with Mixpost, a self-hosted social media management platform.\n- Supports managing accounts, media, tags, and posts using documented API endpoints.\n- Includes setup instructions for environment variables and API authentication.\n- Offers detailed curl examples for common operations: scheduling posts, uploading media, managing tags, and more.\n- Enables management of content across multiple social media platforms from a single interface.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"MIXPOST_URL","required":true},{"key":"MIXPOST_ACCESS_TOKEN","required":true},{"key":"MIXPOST_WORKSPACE_UUID","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"zw008","slug":"vmware-monitor","displayName":"vmware-monitor","summary":"Use this skill for safe, read-only queries of VMware infrastructure — no destructive operations exist in the codebase; a test enforces it. Directly handles: a one-glance cross-cluster health summary, object-centered VM/host/datastore investigation drill-downs (correlating surrounding infrastructure + recent events), a cross-vCenter \"what needs attention now?\" rollup, list VMs/hosts/datastores/clusters, active alarms, recent events, VM details. Always use vmware-monitor when the user asks to \"list VMs\", \"check vSphere alarms\", \"show host status\", \"is anything on fire\", \"what needs attention now\", \"what is happening around this VM/host/datastore\", \"investigate this VM\" — or needs read-only VMware info before making changes. Do NOT use for any write operations — this skill is read-only and has no code path that creates, modifies, or deletes a vSphere resource. For VM modifications use vmware-aiops, for networking use vmware-nsx, for metrics/capacity use vmware-aria. For load balancing/AVI/AKO use vmware-avi.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"esxi":"2.4.2","latest":"2.4.2","monitoring":"2.4.2","read-only":"2.4.2","safety":"2.4.2","vcenter":"2.4.2","vmware":"2.4.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6241,"installs":76,"stars":0,"versions":111},"createdAt":1772499232366,"updatedAt":1792369105727,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.4.2","createdAt":1792368941745,"changelog":"An unreadable host is not reported as down (hosts_unreadable); NTP/inventory no longer call it unreachable; a login refused with NoPermission gets the no-role error","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["macos","linux"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"krisyejh","slug":"wan-image-video-generation-editting","displayName":"Wan Image and Video Generation and Editting","summary":"Image and Video Generation and Editting wiht Wan series models. It offers text2image, image editting(with prompt), text2video, image2video and reference(imag...","description":null,"topics":["Video Generation","Prompt"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6240,"installs":198,"stars":10,"versions":3},"createdAt":1772350370569,"updatedAt":1778491678078,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1773323778378,"changelog":"No user-visible changes in this version.\n\n- No file changes detected.\n- No updates to SKILL.md content except a minor fix: corrected typo in the reference2video options, changing 'character1' to 'character2' for the second file reference.\n- No new features or bug fixes introduced.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"omar-khaleel","slug":"qr-code","displayName":"Advanced QR Intelligence","summary":"Generate and read QR codes. Use when the user wants to create a QR code from text/URL, or decode/read a QR code from an image file. Supports PNG/JPG output and can read QR codes from screenshots or image files.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0","latesutilities":"1.0.0","productivity":"1.0.0","qrt":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6240,"installs":118,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770331656418,"updatedAt":1778486032634,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770331656418,"changelog":"Initial release: High-precision QR generation and decoding modules.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"design","displayName":"Design","summary":"Executes and critiques visual design with quantified rules for hierarchy, spacing, type scale, color, and layout. Use when designing UI screens, landing pages, slides, posters, social graphics, emails, charts, or PDFs, when a design looks off, cluttered, amateur, or flat and the user cannot say why, when nothing stands out or text is hard to read, when choosing fonts, pairing typefaces, or building a palette without a design system, when adapting a screen to dark mode or mobile, or when reviewing generated HTML/CSS before delivery. Not for design tokens and component libraries (design-system) or brand strategy (branding).","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.3"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6237,"installs":140,"stars":6,"versions":4},"createdAt":1770813854716,"updatedAt":1785069754746,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.3","createdAt":1785068807681,"changelog":"Display name shown correctly","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"florianbeer","slug":"network-scanner","displayName":"Network Scanner","summary":"Scan networks to discover devices, gather MAC addresses, vendors, and hostnames. Includes safety checks to prevent accidental scanning of public networks.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6233,"installs":207,"stars":0,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769556065006,"updatedAt":1779076439679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1769941347059,"changelog":"Added homepage metadata, improved safety documentation, enhanced blocklist config format","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}}],"nextCursor":"{\"v\":1,\"index\":\"by_active_stats_downloads\",\"key\":[{\"__undef\":1},6233,1779076439679,1773255932681.595,\"r178facwkznwcxtjkb9ygbx35d82qg3p\"]}"}